1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,280
Welcome all of you.

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,800
And thank you for making the effort to come so promptly.

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:11,320
As all of you know, we have to move out of this building by the end of the month because the owner is asking too much money for rent.

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:16,560
And you also know how difficult it is to rent a place in this city at an affordable price.

5
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:27,360
The head chef and I have spent a lot of time trying to find premises that are both in the right location and have the character we need to maintain the tradition of our restaurant.

6
00:00:28,015 --> 00:00:31,660
Well, you'll be happy to hear that we've found the ideal location.

7
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:39,160
After weeks of fruitless searching, we heard of a first floor site which was originally a French restaurant near the local theater.

8
00:00:40,115 --> 00:00:43,540
We contacted the agents immediately and inspected the site.

9
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:46,840
It's great, and we've signed a 3-year contract.

10
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:50,260
So let's get busy; we have a lot of work to do!

11
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:51,980
Thanks again for your commitment.
